{
  "id": "JDG.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Fuga Laja Girgweaguutka 20",
  "verseCount": 48,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israeli gabada ng'ucheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarudu fuga Israeli, ak gaguuyeata eemeetuw siyagi, gidang'eada Dani ea gagul Beer-sheba, ea ng'eanyiida Gileyadi, gaguyeesa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga hees, was fuga hees bea eemoojiga sean bea Israeli, gaguuyeesa heeda girgweageeda fuga ASEETA, headiga nyiit sagalamnyooji bughalaji ang'wan bea fuga badiina geeshanga, bariida ng'utkeaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyas iita orjooga Benjamini gideaba fuga Israeli nidiyeesa Mispa. Hean gwayi fuga Israeli, “Heapi arukuni munyin geesindaani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean siida Lawi, was siyeeda gatmoodida sinuusiin, ghwanya ghuuta ak gwayeesha, “Aniini ghaahiti Gibeyaheeda Benjamini, aniini ea gwealeedeanyu eegasa heeda ruweanyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka heedeanyu headiga Gibea, ak gwaneaweesa gheeda meatkwajeega sean eawa, nea gagasa gwanuusan, ak gwealeedeanyu geang'waay aba uurda, bwak ea ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geageanu gwealeani iteanyuuni, ak ghaalajaadi gamaning'iidi banyeega saseadaanyi, ak ghaayaachi jeeda ng'eanyoojiga sean bea Israeli; aba gideaba nisin munyinda haw, ea leendeeda aba Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'ula, fuga sean bea Israeli, heapi arukuni gichea alachta girgweageeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eata fugiga siyagi, ak gwayi, “Maygawa eara siyagi jeeda heemajeandaanyi, nea manda siida jea gabiikta gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gichea eesimana fuga Gibea ea nih gil, gajeediyeada aba eeweaya eeng'ucheewana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajealoada fih damanamughuush aba jeeda fih bughala aba jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli, ea fih bughala aba jeeda fih sagalama, ea fih sagalama aba jeeda fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush; gaweay gagakiisa buuneeda gichea ghwaak; ghoah gideaba iihita Gibeyaheeda Benjamini gwasin giduurji leendeeda ghayi sin saawa aba Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguuyeesa headiga sean bea Israeli badayda mujiineedida, nea ghoamughuushta geat siyagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta eemoojiga Israeli fuga jea gaweay jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Benjamini, gwayeesha, “Nih munyinda uurjiini gil mida bugusteang'wean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ooruuta fiisu, was fuga munyasiini bea Gibea, ak geanyaschi gheata jea eenuusa, ak geegeandi munyinda aba Israeli.” Ak ea mamwasa fuga Benjamini gooleeysiit ghuusiga fuga rooroochi was fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguuyeesa Gibea fuga Benjamini, nea ghang'eada jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa, ak gaweay gang'uchi sea diibiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Benjamini rinna jeeda mujiinajeegiga ghwanyiit mooneeda nyaawa fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea lah gea ng'uchiideata ng'utkeaka, nea ghwanaawa gea abiita Gibea, nea mooneeda nyaawa gaba fih bughalaji ispwa sighwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda fuga sean gwanda fih bughalaji ispwa bea fuga sighwal gheadeamnyooji, nea inyeesa gaba siisi ammu gafut uhuuda siida aba makeamooda, nea mayghwaramwas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Israeli, nea meeyiita gea Benjamini, mooneeda nyaawa ghwanyiit fih sagalamnyooji bughalaji ang'wan, gadiydooscheata ng'utkeaka; hean fiisu seaniin fuga ng'ucheeda gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda fuga Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eatng'eat fuga Israeli, ak gaweay Beteli, ak ghamwaash ghoabwaarda aba heeda ASEETA; ak gwayeesha, “Gaygoosheeda ng'eaha aba heedeanya gawa ng'ucheeda aba badayda fuga Benjamini?” Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gaygoosheeda Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gaweay sakteayda fuga Israeli ak gooduuw aba murdeeda Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay fuga Israeli gang'uchi sea Benjamini, ak ghwalach girgweageeda aba badayda nyaawa aba Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarina Gibea diibiga Benjamini, ak ghabwar ea goosha ng'eanyiida, ea fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya bea Israeli eaweedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fugiga, fuga Israeli, ghoahang'waay geat, ak ghwalach girgweageeda niba iyeenya aba heeda ghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadiyeada fuga Israeli ak gooyeawdi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghoah shing'ada, ak goobearsa NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayeesha, “Gaydawa dariikghta dang'uchi sea Benjamini was orjeeda giyeanya?” Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Asi aweayeena ang'ucheewana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga Israeli gwariiksa heeda mida Benjamini eaweedeaba iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Benjamini gawa gang'uchi aba Gibea eaweedeaba iyeenya, ak ghabwar ea gwaduulsa ng'eanyi fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush ea sis, aba jeeda fuga Israeli, fiisu seaniin gea ng'ucheata ng'utkeaka gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga sean bea Israeli, fiisu seaniin, gwadiyeada gaweay Beteli, ak gooyeawdi, goobiitpiit aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gooluulda geat eaweedida ea ghoah shing'ada; ak ghwayiin lukghumajeega sigwariida ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was gea hoyyoo aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobearsa fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA (aba gideaba sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA gwanda hoowa eawoojigiga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Finehasi, was orjeeda Eliyasari bea Haruni, abeeda gamiineadayi aba madeeda sandakweani eawoojigiga), ak gwayi, “Gaydawa gicha dang'uchi sea Benjamini was orjeeda giyeanya, ghana jea danung'waada?” Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Asi adiyeada, aba gideaba numuji gaydayiin geatingaagu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiin Israeli fuga jea ghaghas Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay fuga Israeli gang'uchi sea Benjamini eaweedeaba samwagu, ak ghoamughuush geat gang'uchi sea Gibea, gawuurji gida ghayi sin aba damanyoojiga suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara Benjamini gwarita gaweay gang'uchi saawa, ak geegista gwasheagiideewa mujiineedida; ak ghoang'eat ghabwar nea gwanuus aba jeedeaba fugiga; was diktam ea damanamughuush bea Israeli, gawuurji gida ghayi sin damanyoojiga suuk; aba naweadingiga heesiin, was agi dea weah Beteli, ak deaba iyeenya gawa Gibea, jeeda madameega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Benjamini, “Sibwar aba madeedeanya gawuurji gidaghayi bea mwadi.” Ak fuga Israeli gwayi, “Asi anung' eesalda, ak geegista ghwanung'wa heeda mujiini ak gaweay bugusta naweeda bwara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga sean bea Israeli, ghang'amwa heeda hoorgeeda nyaawa ak ghoamughuush geat aba Baal-tamari, ak neawda Israeli ghang'eada heeda gwachi mida ak gaweay ea ghwahita dirbeayda Geba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush sighwal aba Israeli ghapka sean goodooksiinyi Gibeya, ak ng'ucheedida ea ng'waan muuchi; nea abeeda ea mwanala gideaba munyinda gwanda murdeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwar NG'UTAMIIDA Benjamini aba madeeda Israeli ak gahuuyda fuga Israeli was headi sagalamnyooji diktam ea muut ea bughala, bea fuga Benjamini eaweedida, nea saawa ea fuga ng'ucheata ng'utkeaka gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidajooriischeata Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadaah diibiga Benjamini gideaba sijoar; aba gideaba fuga Israeli ghang'eada madeeda Benjamini, aba gideaba ghamwas fuga naaw ghayi hidu badayda Gibeyahiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fugiga bea neawdean ghwalamwajaada, ak ghaghas Gibea, ak fuga neawda gaweay ak ghabwar mujiineeda sean aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga ghayi silaja bea Israeli sea fuga neawdean nih gil, gayghwanung' gwadiyeada shamooghooda aroosta nea gwarina jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayam geat fuga Israeli aba jeeda ng'ucheeda, ghang'eat Benjamini ghabwar Israeli dea nyiit diktam ea damanamughuush; aba gideaba gwayi, “Aba huumwa sibwar aba madeedeanya gawuurji ng'ucheeda ghayi bea mwadi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea ghang'eat shamooghooda ghabeawa jeeda mujiini, gawuurji daraneeda aroosta, hean goong'weersa bwadaw fuga Benjamini, ak ging'ulayi, mujiineeda sean gwadiyeadawa jeeda aroosta nea gawa humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayam geat fuga Israeli, ak ghwahal geat fuga Benjamini; aba gideaba ghwadaah niriiksa munyinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam saseenuuka nyaawa aba madeeda diibiga Israeli, googeal naweeda weah jeeda dareapcheeda, nea ng'ucheedida ghwaduup geeshta nyaawa aba uurda, nea eara gea rinna jeeda mujiinajeegiga ghabwar gwaduulean aba jeedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata ghwanaaw fuga Benjamini aba meatkwajeega sean ak ghahoan, ak ghoalaaplaap aba heeda fuufa, mida murdeeda Gibea meatkweeda arearuuna aseeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gameewa fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush ea sis bea fuga Benjamini, nea abeeda ea gheareemanga daruusi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam geat ak gwasalsa meatkweeda dareapcheeda ea ghwahita lagheaneeda Rimoni; hean ghoang'waayi aba jeeda fugiga aba bugusta naweeda bwara fih sagalamnyooji muut was headiga; nea gweada geeshta aba ng'weega ea ghwahita Gidomu, ak eara aba hoowa ghabwar aba jeeda nyaawa fih sagalamnyooji iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean mooneeda fuga Benjamini meewa eaweedida ghwanyiit fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea muut, fuga gadiydooscheata ng'utkeaka; fiisu seaniin abeeda ea daruusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayam geat fih bughalaji lah was headiga, ak gwasalsa meatkweeda dareapcheeda ea ghwahita lagheaneeda Rimoni, aba jeeda sheeh iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam geat gicha fuga Israeli gaweesa diibiga Benjamini, ak ghabwara ng'uta, mujiineeda sean, dugwa, ea gilinyoo ghwadaah sean, ak eara mujiinajeega nyooh ghwadaah ghwaahaak beasta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
